{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"진달래꽃","artist":"마야","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:015","sourceHash":"5dc85ef97c92821bf3616d2a581326698c040f79cf3a4f08966830fa170c1bcd","duration":238.32,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":8.707483,"end":13.705,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.477642,"end":20.583,"text":"말없이 고이 보내 드리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":21.455238,"end":27.462,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":28.247075,"end":34.34,"text":"죽어도 아니 눈물 흘리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":36.316009,"end":42.16,"text":"날 떠나 행복한지 이젠 그대 아닌지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":51.33932,"end":57.42,"text":"그댈 바라보며 살아온 내가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":58.688435,"end":64.74,"text":"그녀 뒤에 가렸는지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":68.487256,"end":74.34,"text":"사랑 그 아픔이 너무 커","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":74.710204,"end":81.04,"text":"숨을 쉴 수가 없어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":83.429297,"end":89.48,"text":"그대 행복하길 빌어줄게요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":90.232744,"end":96.0,"text":"내 영혼으로 빌어줄게요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":97.988209,"end":104.06,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":104.199546,"end":107.37,"text":"말없이 고이 보내 드리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":107.45034,"end":110.598,"text":"영변에 약산 진달래꽃","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":110.677914,"end":113.28,"text":"아름따다 가실 길에 뿌리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":113.441088,"end":118.098,"text":"가시는 걸음 놓인 그 꽃을","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":118.177959,"end":122.06,"text":"사뿐히 즈려밟고 가시옵소서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":122.195011,"end":126.34,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":126